{"id": "tea:anubhasya:1.4.26", "source": "src:anubhasya", "location": {"ref": "1.4.26"}, "paraphrase": "Brahman, by transforming itself, is the material cause of the world; this transformation involves no change in Brahman (avikṛta-pariṇāma), as gold remains gold in its ornaments.", "tags": {"level": "ultimate", "standpoint": "cosmic", "naya": null, "path": ["knowledge"], "stage": "all"}, "types": ["ultimate", "world-fate"], "coverage": ["A6"], "reported_by_opponent": false, "ai_translated": false, "fidelity": {"status": "unchecked"}, "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": ["U16-bhedabheda"], "disagreements": []}, "teachers": ["tch:vallabha"], "concepts": ["cpt:avikrta-parinama", "cpt:brahma-parinama"], "terms": ["trm:avikrta-parinama"], "disputes": ["dsp:brahma-parinama-vada", "dsp:causation"], "notes": "The gold simile is standard in Śuddhādvaita exposition; its presence at this sūtra to verify.", "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "moderate", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U16-bhedabheda"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:anubhasya:3.2", "source": "src:anubhasya", "location": {"ref": "3.2"}, "paraphrase": "Brahman is the locus of contradictory attributes (viruddha-dharmāśraya): scripture's statements that it is with and without qualities, near and far, moving and unmoving are all true of it, and are not to be divided into higher and lower truths.", "tags": {"level": "ultimate", "standpoint": "apophatic", "naya": null, "path": ["knowledge"], "stage": "all"}, "types": ["ultimate"], "coverage": ["A6"], "reported_by_opponent": false, "ai_translated": false, "fidelity": {"status": "unchecked"}, "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": ["U16-bhedabheda"], "disagreements": []}, "teachers": ["tch:vallabha"], "concepts": ["cpt:viruddha-dharmasraya"], "terms": ["trm:viruddha-dharmasraya"], "disputes": ["dsp:saguna-nirguna"], "notes": "Pāda-level reference; the doctrine is central to Vallabha, the exact locus to verify.", "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "low", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U16-bhedabheda"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
